Title: Note on a helmet
Author: Captain Pleias
Color: #3D2518

I see Drogo, the zealot. I’m… (hic)… heading ahead (hic) for a talk.
<>[br]

<>I’m feeling confident… though, in the likely case these orcs eat me (hic),
<>I humbly ask whoever finds this…
<>[br]

<>Grant my honorary titles and lands
<>to some lad or lass who actually works for a living.
<>No children here to squabble, so let it be so.
<>[br]

<>Now then—off for a “chat” and a cup of ale
<>with Drogo and his orcs. Argh!!
<>[br]